<aside class="callout caution"><p class="callout__title">assets_dir is read, not processed</p><div class="callout__body"><p>There is no asset pipeline yet. The key is parsed and a site may name a
directory, but nothing fingerprints, minifies or bundles its contents. This
site builds its one stylesheet with the Tailwind CLI and publishes it by hand.
Fingerprinting, bundling and subresource integrity are planned, not present.</p>
</div></aside>
<p>A file whose name starts with <code>_</code> is an input by convention. It is bundled into
whatever imports it and is never published on its own. Today that convention is
enforced by the site's own build script, not by depoth.</p>
