<h2 id="unknown-keys-are-errors">Unknown keys are errors</h2>
Unknown keys are errors
<p>Every table in the configuration rejects keys it does not know. <code>base_ur1</code>
fails the build and names itself in the message. A typo that is quietly ignored
costs more time than any error message does.</p>
<p>The navigation tree is validated as soon as the file parses, before any content
is read. A malformed tree is therefore one error naming one node, not a cascade
of missing-page errors.</p>

