</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>title</code></td>
<td>yes</td>
<td>The page heading, the <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, and the navigation label.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>description</code></td>
<td>no</td>
<td>The page subtitle and the meta description.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>sidebar_title</code></td>
<td>no</td>
<td>A shorter label for the sidebar, when the title is too long for it.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
