dp-layout markers
<p>A layout must mark the element that wraps <strong>exactly</strong> its children with the
prefix it was registered under.</p>
<pre class="hl"><code class="language-rust"><span class="hl-source hl-rust"><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"><span class="hl-storage hl-modifier hl-rust">pub</span> <span class="hl-storage hl-type hl-function hl-rust">fn</span> </span><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-function hl-rust">Docs</span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-parameters hl-rust"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-parameters hl-begin hl-rust">(</span><span class="hl-variable hl-parameter hl-rust">layout</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-rust">:</span> <span class="hl-keyword hl-operator hl-rust">&amp;</span><span class="hl-storage hl-type hl-rust">str</span>, <span class="hl-variable hl-parameter hl-rust">children</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-rust">:</span> Element</span><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-parameters hl-rust"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-parameters hl-end hl-rust">)</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"> <span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-return-type hl-rust"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-rust">-&gt;</span> Element</span> </span><span class="hl-meta hl-function hl-rust"><span class="hl-meta hl-block hl-rust"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-block hl-begin hl-rust">{</span>
