<p>Navigation is one tree, declared in <code>depoth.yaml</code>, outside the content. From it
come the sidebar, the tab bar, the breadcrumbs and the prev/next links. They
are the same data read four ways, so they cannot disagree.</p>
<p>The tree names slugs only. Every title comes from the page's own frontmatter,
so a title is never written in two places. That has a consequence for the
build: the sidebar cannot be built until the content is loaded. The build order
is discover content, read frontmatter, resolve navigation, render.</p>
<h2 id="the-one-child-kind-rule">The one-child-kind rule</h2>
The one-child-kind rule
<p><strong>A node carries exactly one kind of child.</strong> A tab holds groups or pages,
never both. The root holds tabs, or groups, or pages, never two of them.</p>
<p>The rule is Mintlify's and it is worth copying exactly. It is why a 489-page
site stays a readable 1,100-line file: at every level you are reading a list of
one thing, not a mixture you have to sort by eye. It is also why the tree can
be validated rather than merely parsed — a node with two kinds of child has no
single correct rendering, and guessing one produces a sidebar that is wrong in
a way nobody notices.</p>
<p>Three concepts exist and no more: tabs, groups (which nest), and pages. Global
anchors handle the handful of external links. A 489-page production corpus used
exactly that — <code>tabs</code> to <code>groups</code> to nested groups to page strings, four global
anchors and one external-href tab.</p>
<h2 id="the-root">The root</h2>
The root
<p>Exactly one of <code>tabs</code>, <code>groups</code> or <code>pages</code>. <code>anchors</code> may accompany any of
them, because an anchor is a link rather than a container.</p>
<pre class="hl"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="hl-source hl-yaml"><span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">navigation</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span>
  <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">groups</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span>
    <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-block hl-sequence hl-item hl-yaml">-</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">group</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml">Guide</span>
      <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">pages</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span> <span class="hl-meta hl-flow-sequence hl-yaml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-sequence hl-begin hl-yaml">[</span><span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-in hl-yaml">docs/index</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-sequence hl-yaml">,</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-in hl-yaml">docs/install</span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-sequence hl-end hl-yaml">]</span></span>
  <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">anchors</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span>
    <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-block hl-sequence hl-item hl-yaml">-</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">anchor</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml">GitHub</span>
      <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-yaml">href</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-separator hl-key-value hl-mapping hl-yaml">:</span> <span class="hl-string hl-unquoted hl-plain hl-out hl-yaml">https://github.com/DHHwasRight/depoth</span>
</span></code></pre>
<p>Declaring none is an error. Declaring two is an error that names both.</p>
<h2 id="tabs">Tabs</h2>
Tabs
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Key</th>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>tab</code></td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Required. The label.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>icon</code></td>
<td>string</td>
